msgid "Applying Diátaxis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../application.rst:5
#: ad96a7b2209a45ad9ffc0040469e1a52
msgid "The pages in this section are concerned with putting Diátaxis into practice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../application.rst:9
#: c52aade4850e4e54bbfdef73042b1745
msgid "Diátaxis is underpinned by :doc:`systematic theoretical principles <theory>`, but understanding them is not necessary to make effective use of the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../application.rst:11
#: 81bbba5712b0498c8d10e7cbd795bcf7
msgid "Diátaxis is primarily intended as a pragmatic approach for people working on documentation. Most of the key principles required to put it into practice successfully can be grasped intuitively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../application.rst:13
#: 824c335578cb405ea35e7c4369e3115f
msgid "Don't wait to understand Diátaxis before you start trying to put it into practice. Not only do you not need to understand it all to make use of it, you will not understand it until you have started using it (this itself is a Diátaxis principle)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../application.rst:15
#: 57477d3e104f4f96935ac2cfc0185864
msgid "As soon as you feel you have picked up an idea that seems worth applying to your work, try applying it. Come back here when you need more clarity or reassurance. Iterate between your work and reflecting on your work."
msgstr ""

